  "copyright": "© 2021 KENBS",
  "verseCount": 27,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "3",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "EZK 3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "3",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ezekieli okoria egetabu eringire",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene aganteebia, “Aye Mwanyabaanto, karie egento ekio kwaeirwe; karie egetabu eke, erio ogende gokwana n’Abaisraeli.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio ngaasamia omonwa one, na ere akang’a egetabu eria in’yerie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende aganteebia, “Aye Mwanyabaanto, karie egetabu eke ngokoa eichore ase enda yao.” Erio nkayeria, egansa ase omonwa one buna obooke.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ezekieli ogotomwa korenda Abaisraeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Omonene agantebia, “Aye Mwanyabaanto, imoka ogende ase Abaisraeli, okwane nabarabwo amang’ana ane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tindi kogotoma ase abanto bagokwana omonwa omoao otamanyeti, korende ase Abaisraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gose tindi kogotoma ase abanto b’ebisaku ebinge bagokwana emenwa emekong’u, abwo ogokwana kwabo otanyare komanya. Ekeene, onye narenge kogotoma gochia ase abanto buna abwo, nigo barenge gokoigwera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaisraeli tibagokoigwera aye, ekiagera tibari konyigwera inche; Abaisraeli bonsi banyiririe amasio abo, ne chinkoro chiabo boigo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rora, nakorire obosio bwao bobe obokong’u buna ayabo, na obosio bwao igoro bobe obokong’u buna ayabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ee, nakorire obosio bwao igoro bobe obokong’u buna rigena rikorokwa elimasi, rire rikong’u kobua amagena ande. Tobairoka gose koboboa ekero orarore amasio abo, ekiagera abwo nigo bare egesaku getari koigwera.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene akagenderera gokwana nainche, aganteebia, “Aye Mwanyabaanto, amang’ana onsi nkogotebia oyagache ase enkoro yao ime, oyaigwe buya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oimoke ogende ase abanto bamino abwo boosetwe, obateebie ng’a aya naro Omonene agoteeba, kobaragotegerere gose bange kogotegerera.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Omoika okanyimokereria igoro, nkaigwa korwa magega y’ane eriogi buna eri’ogoaka gw’enkoba, rigoteeba: “Obonene bw’Omonene botogigwe korwa agwo ase bore!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaigwa na eriogi rie chimbaaba chi’ebitongwa biria bire moyo chigokunana, na eriogi ri’amagoro aria arenge mbarabare yabo riarenge buna eri’ogoaka gw’enkoba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omoika okanyimokereria igoro, okang’ira aase aao, na inche nkagenda inde nobororo bogwoka ase omoika one, korende okoboko kw’Omonene gokambeka chinguru.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngaika Telabibu ase abanto baria boosetwe bamenyete, ang’e norooche rwa Kebari; nkagenderera kobeera amo nabarabwo aase agwo ase engaki y’amatuko atano na abere inde nomoichano omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omonene ogochora Ezekieli buna omorendi bw’Abaisraeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(Ezek 33:1-9)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero amatuko atano na abere aerete, ring’ana ri’Omonene rigaacha asende, riganteebia:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aye Mwanyabaanto, nakobekire obe omorendi bw’Abaisraeli. Ekero kende gionsi oraigwe ring’ana rikorwa ase omonwa one, aye obateebie ring’ana erio riane ri’okobakuurera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kondateebe ase omokori amabe: Ekeene aye goika okwe, na aye koratige tomokuurera, gose tokwana nomokori amabe oyio ase okomokuurera, erinde atige chinchera chiaye chi’obobe atoorie obogima bwaye, rirorio omokori amabe oyio nakwe ore ase ebibe biaye, korende amanyinga aye nin’yaganie korwa ase okoboko kwao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende aye korakuurere omokori amabe oyio, na ere aange koonchoka korwa ase ebibe biaye, ne chinchera chiaye chi’obobe, oyio goika akwe ore ase ebibe biaye, korende aye omonyene nobe gwatooririe obogima bwao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Naende omonyaboronge karaonchoke atige oboronge bwaye na akore ebibe, inche nimobekere ekegocha ase enchera yaye goika akwe. Onye tikwamokuurerete, ere nakwe ase engencho y’ebibe biaye, na ogokora kwaye kw’oboronge akorete ritang’ani tigokoinyorwa, korende amanyinga aye nin’yaganie korwa ase okoboko kwao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende korakuurere omonyaboronge ng’a takora ebibe, na ere abe takora ebibe, ekeene, ere nabe moyo, ekiagera aigwerete ogokuurerwa, na aye nobe gwatooririe obogima bwao.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ezekieli ogosinywa gokwana",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aroro agwo okoboko kw’Omonene gokambeka chinguru, ere aganteebia, “Imoka, ogende ase ense omweya, na aroro aaria inche ninkwane naye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio nkaimoka, ’nkagenda aaria ase ense omweya, na obonene bw’Omonene bogatenena aroro buna boria konya narorire ang’e norooche rwa Kebari; ekero naborooche, ngatung’ama, nkagwa inse maumama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Omoika ogasoa ime y’ane, ogantenenia, n’Omonene agakwana nainche, aganteebia, “Genda bwesiekere nyomba mwao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende aye Mwanyabaanto, rora nosibwe ne chingori, erinde tonyara kogenda ase egati y’ abanto bao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inche nimbwatanie oromeme rwao namang’ang’ura, na aye obe rimama osinywe kobakuurera; barabwo nigo bare egesaku getari koigwera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende ekero ’ndakwane naye, nimaanore omonwa oo, na aye obateebie iga: Aya naro Omonene agoteeba; Omonto oganetie koigwera, tiga aigwere, na oyo otaganeti koigwera, tiga aange, ekiagera barabwo negesaku getari koigwera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
